  "goodToKnow": "Die Umverteilung is redistribution, especially of income and wealth: Umverteilung von oben nach unten (from rich to poor). It's a core issue in German politics, from debates on the Vermögensteuer (wealth tax, not levied since 1997) to inheritance tax. Between the federal states, money is redistributed through the Finanzausgleich. Umverteilen means to redistribute. Plural: die Umverteilungen."
